## 11. HOW TO TURN IT ON, AND HOW TO TURN IT OFF

Unchanged from the previous report, because nothing here added a switch:

    CRM_LINK_ENABLED=true          # the kill switch. Everything above is dead without it.
    CRM_LINK_BASE_URL=http://ghl_clone_api:8000
    CRM_LINK_TOKEN=ghl_pat_...     # needs `events:write`; add `read` for exact contact matching
    AGENT_RUNTIME_KEY=...          # the internal hop; already set for the agent CRM report

then bind a number with `python -m app.integrations.crm.manage`.

**To turn it off: `CRM_LINK_ENABLED=false`, or disable the `crm_links` row.** Either one
stops all three of the paths added here, at the first branch, before any database work.
Neither requires a code change and neither touches anything the phone system already does.
